om/users/Repiteo"},"body":"While I'd personally prefer to make this syntax even more explicit with a designated `real_t` literal (see: #89720), there's been some resistance to that idea, so this would be the next best approach. Everything checks out from where I sit, so let's roll with it!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109800#pullrequestreview-4563404379","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109800","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-06-24T15:03:02Z"}]